    "text": "**Business & market dynamics:** Nuix’s core operations are gaining momentum, propelled by a surge in adoption of the next-generation Nuix Neo platform, which now accounts for a meaningful share of total contract value. Demand remains broad-based, with strong geographic performance in EMEA and North America, while Asia Pacific contracted. The AI-enhanced forensic analytics capabilities are being positioned as a structural differentiator. Customer churn improved, and net dollar retention remained expansionary, albeit at a more moderate pace, reflecting a larger and maturing installed base successfully transitioning toward the new platform.\n\n**Management strategy and execution:** Management is systematically migrating the customer base to Nuix Neo through a dedicated migration program, aiming to deepen relationships and accelerate contract value growth. The strategy couples high ongoing R&D investment with the integration of flexible large-language-model capabilities, reinforcing the platform’s technological edge. Disciplined execution is evident in the return to positive cash generation and widening profitability, while the reaffirmation of full-year guidance signals growing confidence in the strategic roadmap and a credible focus on scaling the business efficiently.",
